note Moving along the call graph: the queries the agent navigates with, and the commands that print them. Everything here is derived from the callee and caller lists link built, so it is only as good as the backend that produced them. Roots are strictly 'calls something, called by nothing'. Call trees are pre-order, depth-limited, and visit each symbol at most once, which is what makes promote produce a tree rather than an explosion.

