symbol call_tree
lines 0 22
hash b81e86551466166b
note Pre-order, depth-limited walk from one symbol, each symbol at most once, as a list of (symbol, depth) TreeEntry rows. An explicit stack with callees pushed in reverse keeps the code's call order; the seen set is what stops a cycle and also what makes a shared callee appear under its first caller only. This is the shape a promoted path takes (Map::promote walks it) and the shape the tree command prints.

