note callers: with servers (the CLI), the language server's incoming calls for the symbol, which cover files nothing has indexed, each turned into its calling symbol by by_line; without them (the GUI's command line), the callers link derived. Every symbol of that name is answered, so an unqualified ambiguous name shows all of them.

